<title>UK: IFC sets $50 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>IFC sets $50 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg and Toyo Secs Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON    *5.81	MATURITY    05.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p> NOTES	SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
